      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Scope and status",
      "items": [
        "Usage extension approved October 29, 2026. P14 implementation is local and awaiting phase review; publication and deployment are not approved.",
        "P14 supervision/common budget and additive usage sidecar/API fields form this subsystem. Shared common-v2 budget bytes stay unchanged.",
        "Citations pin base requirements; local P14 code is uncommitted. Logical subsystem map, no hosting changes."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Precise measurements",
      "items": [
        "Observe supervised process elapsed time; distinguish queue/assignment/lease and provider VM time.",
        "Confirmed exit can close a continuous same-clock interval. Unknown orphan gaps remain incomplete or unavailable.",
        "Snapshot logical reserved bytes and measured retained P14-owned output bytes; neither is a monetary charge or whole-host physical usage."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Authority and cancellation history",
      "items": [
        "Cleanup operation ID + attempt/fence + request digest; identical retry returns original result, changed payload conflicts.",
        "Append-only observations preserve cancel/recovery history; do not sum repeated cumulative intervals or snapshots.",
        "Late cleanup-only observations never revive terminal outcomes, renew leases or grant artifact/event writes."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Approved P14 surface",
      "items": [
        "Canonical optional cleanup usage DTOs and optional RunAttempt usage in existing RunDetail; no new UI screen.",
        "Unpublished 0014 sidecar table; observation and cleanup receipt persist in the same transaction.",
        "Additive local usage_snapshot(); frozen StopResult/ClosedOutput/DiskBudget signatures remain unchanged."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "What remains future work",
      "items": [
        "Cost status UNAVAILABLE, amount absent/null; unknown never means zero or free.",
        "Actual resource metering, versioned rates, spend limits and provider reconciliation stay with P23.5.",
        "Invoices, credits/refunds and billable policy need separate scope. P17 evaluation and P23 retention keep their ownership."
      ]
    }
  ]
